# No extension, and that is legal. With a `tasks_from:` the extensionless form is probed
# FIRST (role/__init__.py:429-431), so this file wins over setup.yml next door — the
# opposite of the default entry point's order.
- name: GOOD the extensionless file wins under tasks_from
  ansible.builtin.debug:
    msg: loaded from tasks/setup
